--- a/CHANGES.rst
+++ b/CHANGES.rst
@@ -5,6 +5,9 @@ Version 8.2.0
 
 Unreleased
 
+-   Close resources registered with ``Context.call_on_close`` and
+    ``Context.with_resource`` before exiting with ``Context.exit``, including
+    during eager option callbacks.
 -   Drop support for Python 3.7. :pr:`2588`
 -   Use modern packaging metadata with ``pyproject.toml`` instead of ``setup.cfg``.
     :pr:`326`
